WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.475
One click runs the event once, and only one branch.

2
00:00:04.455 --> 00:00:07.205
One On clicked event, with two branches.

3
00:00:09.312 --> 00:00:12.437
The box was empty, so the first branch ticks it.

4
00:00:14.281 --> 00:00:17.456
Now it's ticked, so the Else runs and unticks it.

5
00:00:20.456 --> 00:00:23.256
Each click, exactly one branch runs.
